# XR / ICH lab — agent constants

```text
DEVICE: iPhone XR n841ap, A12, iOS 18.7.5 (22H311)
ENTRY: usbliter8 SecureROM pwn + ICH A12 ramdisk (tethered)
JBROOT: /mnt2/root/jb only (NOT /mnt2/jb, NOT classic /var/jb on disk)
/mnt1 = System (treat RO — do not write JB here)
/mnt2 = Data (writable)
SSH: iproxy 2222 22, root/alpine
PATH rule: never put JBROOT first until a full-path binary runs without Killed: 9
Bootstrap: Procursus CFVER 3000 already extracted; do not re-download unless tree is missing
```

## Enforce
- Prefer Mac + `~/Projects/ICH_A12_plus_Ramdisk` for boot/SSH (`tools/darwin/iproxy`).
- Install / stage packages only under **`/mnt2/root/jb`** (or `/mnt2/tmp/…` staging).
- Do **not** create or prefer `/mnt2/jb` — new top-level Data dirs reject file creates.
- Do **not** assume ramdisk `/var/jb` exists (ramdisk `/` is RO; `/var` ≠ Data).
- Verify with **full-path** exec only, e.g. `/mnt2/root/jb/usr/bin/dpkg --version`.
- Status twin: `docs/STATUS.md` + `PROJECT_STATUS.md`. Lab ops: `LAB_AGENT_RULES.md`.
